sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-menshykau-gdnf-ret-ureteric-kidney> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-menshykau-gdnf-ret-ureteric-kidney-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-menshykau-gdnf-ret-ureteric-kidney-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Menshykau & Iber (2013) & Short et al. (2014) GDNF-RET-Wnt11-Sprouty1 kidney ureteric bud Turing branching morphogenesis — MorphoEval overall 55.3/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2014-menshykau-gdnf-ret-ureteric-kidney.py` (overall weighted score: 56.8/100). The v1 script evaluates the homogeneous steady state (R*, G*) and linearized Turing dispersion polynomial of the Schnakenberg GDNF-RET system, but replaces spatial PDE integration and growing ureteric tree branching with a hardcoded cosine profile and symmetric 2^g tip formula, omits Horton-Strahler R_b / R_L morphometry and the 5-condition perturbation suite (Spry1-/-, GDNF bead, BMP4 inhibition, Gdnf-/-/Ret-/- agenesis), and does not segment the vendored E12.5 kidney ureteric bud specimen image. Overall 55.3/100 (faithfulness 49.0, reproducibility 70.0); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 58, Morphological realism / specimen match 38, Parameter expressivity 48, Morphometric validation 56, Source and data traceability 74, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/gdnf_ret_ureteric_kidney_comparison.png: rendered output of 2014-menshykau-gdnf-ret-ureteric-kidney.py at 8871db0, image/png, 162204 B, 1430×1040 px, artifact_sha256 b6dffcc27cc9e87cd955dce6c687a8cd9da250d930f2a985ca3e0ae5ad93512c (sha256 b6dffcc27cc9e87cd955dce6c687a8cd9da250d930f2a985ca3e0ae5ad93512c), spec_fingerprint ce5c8398e3a08e65321d450b66315cd37e3849e22cf0f960d5077e262860f3b9. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: ce5c8398e3a08e65321d450b66315cd37e3849e22cf0f960d5077e262860f3b9; artifact_sha256: b6dffcc27cc9e87cd955dce6c687a8cd9da250d930f2a985ca3e0ae5ad93512c; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/gdnf_ret_ureteric_kidney/gdnf_ret_ureteric_kidney_reference.json=8f7910ca67a34e52..., datasets/gdnf_ret_ureteric_kidney/kidney_ureteric_tree_specimen.jpg=dceaf5044c7014e4..., datasets/gdnf_ret_ureteric_kidney/paper_citations.bib=62f203a6f4125269..., datasets/gdnf_ret_ureteric_kidney/scout_manifest.json=60b78a1876b45c42...}." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add runtime SHA-256 verification of all 4 dataset files, expose CLI overrides (`--rho-G`, `--gamma`, `--D-ratio`, `--bmp4`, `--seed`), and expand `measure_morphoeval()` and `self_test()` to 9 quantitative morphometrics and 8 verification checks.",
            "remediation needed: Implement OpenCV/SciPy computer-vision segmentation of `datasets/gdnf_ret_ureteric_kidney/kidney_ureteric_tree_specimen.jpg` extracting E12.5 wild-type (Panel A) vs hypomorphic mutant (Panel B) ureteric tip counts, skeletonized branch lengths, calyx bifurcation angles, and pErk1/2 tip signaling ratios.",
            "remediation needed: Implement a 2D/3D coupled mesenchymal GDNF + epithelial RET + Wnt11 + Sprouty1 reaction-diffusion solver and growing ureteric tree generator across E11.5-E15.5 (generations g=1..8) that reproduces Short et al. (2014) tip counts, Horton-Strahler bifurcation ratio R_b approx 2.08, length ratio R_L approx 1.38, and bilateral (m=2) vs trifurcating (m=3) ampulla mode selection.",
            "remediation needed: Implement the 5-condition perturbation suite: Wild-Type dichotomous ureteric tree, Spry1-/- ectopic supernumerary budding & trifurcation, exogenous GDNF-soaked bead attraction & ampulla swelling, BMP4 stalk-elongation inhibition, and Gdnf-/-/Ret-/- renal agenesis negative control." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.553"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 055 Pass 1 Assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

